International Purchasing & Negotiation Trainee (with Italian proficiency) with FLEXIBLE DATES
EUROPEAN CITIZENSHIP REQUIRED!
We are looking for charismatic and proactive colleagues to join our growing international team! If you speak Italian and are passionate about communication, learning, and results, this opportunity could be your perfect match. No prior experience is needed—just the right mindset and a strong desire to grow.

Other Benefits:
- Bonus pay based on performance;
- Additional pay in benefits platform;
- Initial training and coaching specific to carried out activity;
- Real career development opportunities in a professional environment, along with dynamic and successful teams;
- Opportunity to work in an international company with headquarters in 7 countries;
- Opportunity to travel internationally.
- Relaxation areas carefully designed at the office;
- Possibility to participate in activities, competitions, animations in various HR projects;
- Free coffee and tea;

